## L-033 — TYP-01 method contract and dual-context specimen matrix are frozen

**State:** TYP-01 METHOD CONTRACT FROZEN / CLEAN / SPECIMEN MATERIALIZATION AUTHORIZED / NO BLINDED SCORING YET / NO CONVERGENCE

The TYP-01 strong-independence method is now frozen in the machine-readable contract `docs/evidence/TYP_01_TYPOGRAPHIC_EDITORIAL_IDENTITY_INDEPENDENCE_METHOD_AND_MATRIX_01.json`. It tests typographic/editorial grammar before typeface selection and deliberately removes existing shared-brand carriers from scored specimens: Kymaean/Ensemble naming, Threshold K, O3, palette/material cues, imagery, Quiet-Stage composition, relational traces, hero geometry, motion, icons/rules and bespoke glyph drawing.

The contract fixes one measurement-only content packet, one neutral `system-ui, sans-serif` fixture stack, neutral black-on-white measurement colors, four materially different grammar families (`F1` Quiet Structure, `F2` Dramatic Cadence, `F3` Human-State Counterpoint, `F4` Compression / Release), a generic negative control, an obvious pairing-calibration positive control, WEB and APP context adaptations, WIDE and 320px conditions, and an exact Cartesian matrix of 24 specimens. Typeface/weight values are fixture variables only and gain no identity-selection authority.

The method is conjunctive and non-compensating. Before blinded review, the implementation must pass exact-content/order, same-computed-face, exclusion, contrast, 200% resize, 320px reflow, WCAG text-spacing stress, app scanability and cross-context invariant checks. A valid review requires at least three records, a successful positive pairing control, a discriminating negative control, independent WEB↔APP pairing at both widths, frozen 0/1/2 dimensions, forced genericity classification and at least one Director/independent visual review outside the construction author as sole judge.

After scoring begins there is no family refinement or fifth-family addition inside TYP-01. Only a mechanical correction that restores a violated frozen rule may restart the affected review. Zero survivors close the strong-independence test; one survivor establishes only one viable mechanism; two or more may promote at most two materially distinct mechanisms as Phase-B evidence. No outcome automatically selects a typeface/system, satisfies broader Phase-B convergence or authorizes Phase C.

**Next gate:** materialize the deterministic text-only harness and manifest under `prototypes/typ-01/`, freeze the computed reference-face/environment metadata and source hashes, and pass structural/accessibility preflight before any blinded scoring.

**Guardrail:** no image generation, generative renderer use/spend, final font/typeface/typography system, final identity/hero, O3 or Threshold-K redesign, palette/material reopening, Quiet-Stage/hero refinement, app implementation, website production/deployment or transcript-dependent Stage motion.

